{"unit_id":"deadbushxw__dsh-self-restart#card-zh","repo":"deadbushxw/dsh-self-restart","commit":"6d290e5b12c33ed5834bda0786c93573d2f47780","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-self-restart 是面向 DSH Web/桌面版的插件，提供宿主工具和浏览器侧刷新控件。它检查插件源目录与已安装副本、判断代码改动需要重试客户端模块、刷新页面还是重启宿主；也可从工具调用发起 Windows 重启，并在同一会话恢复后交付续接消息。它还提供状态查看和重启结果自检，适合更新插件后希望减少手工判断、继续原会话的 DSH 用户。配置通过 bundle 或插件数据目录中的 JSON 文件读取，无需 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:38"]}
{"unit_id":"deadbushxw__dsh-self-restart#card-en","repo":"deadbushxw/dsh-self-restart","commit":"6d290e5b12c33ed5834bda0786c93573d2f47780","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-self-restart adds DSH tools to classify changes as client retry, page reload, or restart, plus a browser reload control. On Windows, it restarts DSH and resumes the same conversation. Status and self-check tools report restart state. Local configuration; no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:38"]}
