{"unit_id":"deadbushxw__dsh-self-restart#feature-1","repo":"deadbushxw/dsh-self-restart","commit":"6d290e5b12c33ed5834bda0786c93573d2f47780","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「按改动应用」：检查插件源目录和安装副本，并依据改动类型选择无操作、重试客户端入口、刷新页面或重启。可先用 dryRun 查看决定。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1246"]}
{"unit_id":"deadbushxw__dsh-self-restart#feature-2","repo":"deadbushxw/dsh-self-restart","commit":"6d290e5b12c33ed5834bda0786c93573d2f47780","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「重启并续接会话」：工具调用写入重启票据，等待当前回合结束后重启 Windows 上的 DSH，并在新进程中向同一会话发送续接消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1308"]}
{"unit_id":"deadbushxw__dsh-self-restart#feature-3","repo":"deadbushxw/dsh-self-restart","commit":"6d290e5b12c33ed5834bda0786c93573d2f47780","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「刷新页面」：调用工具或点击侧栏底部刷新按钮重载浏览器页面；页面重新载入后向宿主确认，宿主据此报告刷新是否完成。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1366"]}
{"unit_id":"deadbushxw__dsh-self-restart#feature-4","repo":"deadbushxw/dsh-self-restart","commit":"6d290e5b12c33ed5834bda0786c93573d2f47780","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「状态与自检」：查看宿主和窗口进程、配置问题及重启票据；重启后比较代码指纹并检查执行记录，确认新一代进程是否加载代码。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1077"]}
{"unit_id":"deadbushxw__dsh-self-restart#caveat-1","repo":"deadbushxw/dsh-self-restart","commit":"6d290e5b12c33ed5834bda0786c93573d2f47780","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-self-restart 的宿主重启流程仅实现 Windows 进程关闭与重新启动；其他平台上该流程会拒绝执行，浏览器页面刷新功能仍可使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:790"]}
